# Tiny Swords terrain

Read [`.tile_debug/tinyswords_guide.json`](../../.tile_debug/tinyswords_guide.json) before changing terrain rendering or elevation generation.

## Rules

- Draw order: water → foam (el 0 only) → elevation layers 0..N (shadow → grass → cliff bases).
- Autotile mask uses 4 neighbours; **same** = elevation ≥ cell elevation.
- Cliffs face **south only**; one cliff-base row per drop. Pieces 17–20 (land) or 21–24 (water).
- Shadow sprite is 128×128, placed one tile below elevated walkable cells.
- `Tilemap_color{N}.png` palette matches elevation `N-1` (color1 = el 0, color2 = el 1, …).
- Regenerate data: `python scripts/generate_world_elevation.py` after collision changes.

See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for file map and generator notes.
